        "text": "The target is October 2026 total nonfarm job openings on the month's last business day, seasonally adjusted, BLS series JTS000000000000000JOL, Table 1. All openings anchors and historical observations use this same variant. HistoricalContext contains original preliminary prints retrieved from dated BLS archives."
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The official calendar at https://www.bls.gov/schedule/news_release/jolts.htm explicitly schedules October 2026 JOLTS for December 1, 2026, at 10:00 AM. It schedules September data for November 3. August is therefore the latest published openings period in this run, leaving two monthly transitions to the target."
