        "result": "Fetched current-vintage SA openings, thousands. January-December 2025 respectively: 7431, 7242, 6952, 7098, 7310, 7204, 7089, 6919, 7169, 7170, 6846, 6550. January-August 2026 respectively: 7240, 6922, 6887, 7585, 7537, 7182, 7335, 7079. Earlier observations include revisions; August is preliminary."
